---
// Picture first for the broker section: sender, broker, readers. Plain inline SVG, site tokens, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const notes = [
  { icon: 'hourglass', en: 'Buffers when readers are slow', vi: 'Đệm lại khi bên đọc chậm' },
  { icon: 'retry', en: 'Redelivers after a crash', vi: 'Gửi lại sau khi bên đọc sập' },
  { icon: 'users', en: 'One message, many readers', vi: 'Một message, nhiều bên đọc' },
] as const;
---
<figure class="bo">
  <div class="bo-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 290" role="img" aria-label="A message broker sits between a sender and its readers. The producer puts a message on the broker and moves on. The broker holds it. Two consumers read it later. The broker buffers when readers are slow, redelivers after a crash, and lets one message reach many readers, but it does not care what the bytes mean.">
    <rect x="20" y="40" width="190" height="100" rx="5" class="bo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={52} y={90} size={32} />
    <text x="82" y="84" class="bo-title">Producer</text>
    <text x="82" y="106" class="bo-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>sends, moves on</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>gửi rồi đi tiếp</tspan>
    </text>

    <path d="M212,90 L328,90" class="bo-arrow" />
    <polygon points="327,85 327,95 336,90" class="bo-head" />

    <rect x="340" y="40" width="220" height="100" rx="5" class="bo-box is-key" />
    <DiagramIcon name="log" x={374} y={90} size={32} />
    <text x="404" y="84" class="bo-title">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Message broker</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Message broker</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="404" y="106" class="bo-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>holds the bytes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>giữ các byte</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="404" y="124" class="bo-small">
      <tspan data-lang-en>not what they mean</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>không biết nghĩa</tspan>
    </text>

    <path d="M562,72 L688,58" class="bo-arrow" />
    <polygon points="687,53 686,63 695,57" class="bo-head" />
    <path d="M562,108 L688,122" class="bo-arrow" />
    <polygon points="686,117 687,127 695,123" class="bo-head" />

    <rect x="700" y="30" width="180" height="56" rx="5" class="bo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={728} y={58} size={26} />
    <text x="752" y="63" class="bo-title">Consumer A</text>
    <rect x="700" y="94" width="180" height="56" rx="5" class="bo-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={728} y={122} size={26} />
    <text x="752" y="127" class="bo-title">Consumer B</text>

    {notes.map((n, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={20 + i * 292} y="190" width="276" height="60" rx="5" class="bo-note" />
        <DiagramIcon name={n.icon} x={50 + i * 292} y={220} size={26} />
        <text x={78 + i * 292} y="225" class="bo-small-b">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{n.en}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{n.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Because the broker ignores the contents, the producer and consumers must agree on the encoding, and keep agreeing as it changes.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì broker không quan tâm nội dung, producer và consumer phải thống nhất cách mã hoá, và tiếp tục thống nhất khi nó đổi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bo { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bo-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bo svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bo text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bo .bo-title { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bo .bo-small { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bo .bo-small-b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .bo-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bo-box.is-key { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bo-note { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bo-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bo-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bo figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
